    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/a89d03cc10635fe02b9a4e6c678dc2d1.poster.avif?t=1748449938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/a89d03cc10635fe02b9a4e6c678dc2d1.webm?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/a89d03cc10635fe02b9a4e6c678dc2d1.mp4?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>I think there's something wrong inside my head.</i><br>Follow Joe, an absolute mess of a person, as he wanders blindly from place to place in hopes of finding something that can distract him from his sickness.<br>His shattered mind is beyond repair. So let's just ignore it, okay?<br>Ignore it. Leave it to rot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/f0587ab879ab44ff5c04adfc19df1f74.poster.avif?t=1748449938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/f0587ab879ab44ff5c04adfc19df1f74.webm?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/f0587ab879ab44ff5c04adfc19df1f74.mp4?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Let the whims of the world guide your hand, so that you may lose yourself in carnal pleasure.<br>There is beauty in patience. There is beauty in silence.<br>There is beauty in being the cause of another's madness.<br>Even in death, this is all I could've asked for.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/cbffdeac9f6739ec84a2b0ff1f8cea55.poster.avif?t=1748449938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/cbffdeac9f6739ec84a2b0ff1f8cea55.webm?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/cbffdeac9f6739ec84a2b0ff1f8cea55.mp4?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Often compared to titles like Doki Doki Literature Club and Needy Streamer Overload, <i>Unraveling Angel</i> is a psychological horror visual novel with dating sim elements. Your choices determine the route you end up on and the ending you get.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/57898f6394313a341e5c83ab407c2a52.poster.avif?t=1748449938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/57898f6394313a341e5c83ab407c2a52.webm?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479490/extras/57898f6394313a341e5c83ab407c2a52.mp4?t=1748449938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 love interests, each with their own route (2 M / 1 F)<br></li><li> Beautiful hand drawn art<br></li><li> Multiple perspectives<br></li><li> Unique GUI that mimics an operating system<br></li><li> 1 redhead boyfriend who hates you</li></ul>",
